{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:18280d84b6e90505","name":"Makashi Riposte","source":{"id":"source:reference-18280d84b6e90505","title":"Makashi Riposte","revision":20477,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:55:40Z","sha256":"4fe06e7ca3840a0fa9c8cdc5da9a27e41b3a13f44cfac0506b7ff68b01b9124f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20477","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Makashi%20Riposte&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-18280d84b6e90505","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["[",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Form"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Form"}]},"]"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are trained in a ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Makashi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Makashi"}]}," technique that allows you to slightly change the angle of an opponent's attack before striking with a decisive riposte of your own.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," (when an adjacent opponent makes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," against you)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," Self, plus one enemy within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check."]}," Compare the results of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check against the attack roll of the incoming attack. If your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check equals or exceeds the incoming attack roll, the attack deals half damage on a hit. Additionally, you can make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," against your target after the damage is resolved. You deal half damage to the target on a miss.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Lightsaber Form (",{"tag":"a","children":["Makashi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Makashi"},"):"]}," If you have the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Makashi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Makashi"}]}," Talent, until the end of your next turn, the target provokes an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," from you if it makes an attack and is within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to take no damage from the incoming attack if your check equals or exceeds the attack roll of the incoming attack.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
